{"id":"n25113-1-8","stage":5,"title":"전구 · 灯泡","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25113-1-8-1","ko":"불을 켰는데도 환하지가 않네.","zh":"灯开了也不亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"불을","meaning":"火","explanation":"불：火；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"2","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불을","audio":"/audio/a442b1b030964d74bceb.mp3"}},{"text":"켰는데도","meaning":"打开，发动","explanation":"켜다：打开，发动；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"켜다","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72168","senseId":"2","lemma":"켜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"켰는데도","audio":"/audio/38357108636e9898368b.mp3"}},{"text":"환하지가","meaning":"明亮，亮，亮堂","explanation":"환하다：明亮，亮，亮堂；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；가：附在名词化表达等后加强强调，如 먹지를 못하다（怎么也吃不下）。","readings":[{"term":"환하다","audio":"/audio/14112325e485b805f0e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87071","senseId":"1","lemma":"환하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"환하지가","audio":"/audio/90250f09744f04b9e4e7.mp3"}},{"text":"않네.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않네","audio":"/audio/b40e55f0ebdbecd446e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"发出光亮、照亮黑暗的物体。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"c21cbaed08b52b5b","term":"켜다","zh":"打开，发动","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3","entryId":"72168","definition":"让电器等运转。","pronunciation":["켜다"]},{"id":"14112325e485b805","term":"환하다","zh":"明亮，亮，亮堂","audio":"/audio/14112325e485b805f0e1.mp3","entryId":"87071","definition":"光线照射清晰而亮。","pronunciation":["환ː하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/d5a54c9d06efbd2ebe40.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25113-1-8-2","ko":"전구가 다 됐나 봐. 갈아야겠네.","zh":"灯泡可能快到使用寿命了，得换一个。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전구가","meaning":"灯泡，电灯泡","explanation":"전구：灯泡，电灯泡；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전구","audio":"/audio/90070362f6c4e31efaf9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25113","senseId":"1","lemma":"전구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전구가","audio":"/audio/e6ee9c26ac11dc4aa64c.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"됐나","meaning":"用完，没有","explanation":"되다：用完，没有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"15","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐나","audio":"/audio/063b0c9ece60817f386e.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"갈아야겠네.","meaning":"换，更换","explanation":"갈다：换，更换；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"갈다","audio":"/audio/5e94c618238a75a7c497.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59937","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈아야겠네","audio":"/audio/15f467932d7e669e3b79.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"90070362f6c4e31e","term":"전구","zh":"灯泡，电灯泡","audio":"/audio/90070362f6c4e31efaf9.mp3","entryId":"25113","definition":"通电后可以发光的，用玻璃做成的圆形器具。","pronunciation":["전ː구"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"用完，没有","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某种事物不再发挥功能或寿命已尽。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"5e94c618238a75a7","term":"갈다","zh":"换，更换","audio":"/audio/5e94c618238a75a7c497.mp3","entryId":"59937","definition":"收起原来的东西，在那个位置放上别的东西作为替代。","pronunciation":["갈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b9cce9ccca7aa16614a8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.369,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25113","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":161,"sequenceScore":3.1957,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["灯开了也不亮啊。","灯泡可能快到使用寿命了，得换一个。","我正在找适合中年男性的帽子。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["灯开了也不亮啊。","灯泡可能快到使用寿命了，得换一个。","我正在找适合中年男性的帽子。"],"answer":1}]}
